ion modeling with LuGre dynamics and limit surfaces\"\nPublished in IEEE Transactions on Robotics (T-RO). \u003ca href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.01123v3\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://arxiv.org/abs/2308.01123v3\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\"Perception, control, and hardware for in-hand slip-aware object manipulation with parallel grippers\" Published in the International Journal of Robotics Research (JRR). \u003ca href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.19660\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://arxiv.org/abs/2410.19660\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\"Friction Estimation for In-Hand Planar Motion\" (ISER 2025). \u003ca href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.06824\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://arxiv.org/abs/2507.06824\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\"Deformable In-Hand Slip-Aware Tactile Sensor with Integrated Velocity, Force/Torque, and Pressure Map Sensing\" In submission, with a preprint available on arXiv. \u003ca href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.11952\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://arxiv.org/abs/2606.11952\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSome of the work shown in the video has not yet been submitted for publication.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n","description_plain":"\u003e This is a popular-science presentation, where I explore my PhD research on in-hand sliding manipulation with robotic grippers and tactile sensing.\r\n\u003e\r\n\u003e The focus has been on friction modeling and perception with tactile sensing. The simple parallel gripper might not be the first thought when you think about dexterity with robotic grippers.\r\n\u003e\r\n\u003e The video is based on my research papers:\r\n\u003e\r\n\u003e \"Planar friction modeling with LuGre dynamics and limit surfaces\"\r\nPublished in IEEE Transactions on Robotics (T-RO). https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.01123v3\r\n\u003e\r\n\u003e \"Perception, control, and hardware for in-hand slip-aware object manipulation with parallel grippers\" Published in the International Journal of Robotics Research (JRR). https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.19660\r\n\u003e\r\n\u003e \"Friction Estimation for In-Hand Planar Motion\" (ISER 2025). https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.06824\r\n\u003e\r\n\u003e \"Deformable In-Hand Slip-Aware Tactile Sensor with Integrated Velocity, Force/Torque, and Pressure Map Sensing\" In submission, with a preprint available on arXiv. https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.11952\r\n\u003e\r\n\u003e Some of the work shown in the video has not yet been submitted for publication.","submitter_user":"fanf","user_is_author":false,"tags":["hardware","video"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/ml3mgf","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/ml3mgf/why_is_this_robot_slowly_dropping_object"},{"short_id":"38tyzg","created_at":"2026-09-09T08:52:54.979-05:00","title":"What's a computer?","url":"https://blog.ctms.me/posts/2026-07-15-being-away-from-computers/","score":2,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"hawski","user_is_author":false,"tags":["culture"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/38tyzg","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/38tyzg/what_s_computer"},{"short_id":"veafpx","created_at":"2026-09-09T08:32:22.032-05:00","title":"The purpose of DNS is to spread scams","url":"https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2026/09/the-purpose-of-dns-is-to-spread-scams/","score":19,"flags":0,"comment_count":14,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"whjms","user_is_author":false,"tags":["web"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/veafpx","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/veafpx/purpose_dns_is_spread_scams"},{"short_id":"td6ssk","created_at":"2026-09-09T08:24:26.568-05:00","title":"Analysing 2048 on a 3×3 board","url":"https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/quasiblog/small2048/","score":8,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"calvin","user_is_author":false,"tags":["games"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/td6ssk","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/td6ssk/analysing_2048_on_3x3_board"}